WEBVTT

00:00:06.480 --> 00:00:07.810
Seriously...

00:00:07.810 --> 00:00:12.150
I've explained the dangers of operating the old-type Coupling mecha so many times.

00:00:12.150 --> 00:00:14.320
This is why I can't trust these "pilots".

00:00:16.990 --> 00:00:20.790
Maybe I am the Hina you knew.

00:00:20.790 --> 00:00:23.520
Come with us, to the Cygnus!

00:00:23.620 --> 00:00:24.830
Thank you.

00:00:25.430 --> 00:00:26.330
But...

00:00:31.800 --> 00:00:34.240
No abnormalities detected in either of their brain waves.

00:00:34.240 --> 00:00:35.140
Is that so?

00:00:35.140 --> 00:00:36.140
Thank God.

00:00:36.140 --> 00:00:39.680
However, Dio's Emphater level has diverged even more.

00:00:39.680 --> 00:00:41.100
His Emphater level?

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:42.330
Let's see...

00:00:42.330 --> 00:00:42.930
No way.

00:00:42.930 --> 00:00:44.890
+15%!

00:00:44.890 --> 00:00:46.930
I thought so.

00:00:46.930 --> 00:00:50.940
During the last battle, there was a program in the Valiancers to prevent a Coupling.

00:00:50.940 --> 00:00:54.320
Yet those two overrode it and performed one.

00:00:54.820 --> 00:00:59.600
Their bond has already exceeded my expectations.

00:01:04.580 --> 00:01:07.420
Dio, what's wrong?

00:01:07.420 --> 00:01:10.920
You... really did come from the past, huh?

00:01:11.180 --> 00:01:11.890
What?

00:01:17.000 --> 00:01:19.040
Spread your wings

00:01:19.040 --> 00:01:23.670
See the light of hope in the sky you have yet to witness

00:01:23.670 --> 00:01:26.970
And don't ever give in to the weight of sorrow

00:01:26.970 --> 00:01:32.350
Echo unto eternity, "Unisonia"

00:01:37.100 --> 00:01:41.610
That world you see before your eyes

00:01:41.610 --> 00:01:47.200
I wonder what colors it is made of

00:01:49.320 --> 00:01:51.660
The pain of loss isn't something

00:01:52.280 --> 00:01:54.620
You want to get used to, and yet

00:01:54.620 --> 00:01:59.580
Even on a night like this, the stars glisten

00:02:00.580 --> 00:02:06.550
Like a tarnished coin spilling from the palm of your hand

00:02:06.840 --> 00:02:08.380
Can't go back

00:02:08.380 --> 00:02:09.800
Want to go home

00:02:09.800 --> 00:02:13.140
The two of them back-to-back

00:02:13.140 --> 00:02:15.180
Break through

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:19.940
Turning unfading emotions into a lasting bond

00:02:19.940 --> 00:02:23.270
Like painting over a colorless world

00:02:23.270 --> 00:02:25.990
Let this sympathy reach

00:02:27.320 --> 00:02:32.240
Let's build the future that we envision

00:02:32.240 --> 00:02:35.450
You'll see, we'll even change fate

00:02:35.450 --> 00:02:40.250
Transcending time, "Unisonia"

00:03:08.250 --> 00:03:09.870
Who was that guy?

00:03:10.510 --> 00:03:11.750
That guy?

00:03:11.750 --> 00:03:15.040
The guy who was with you when your father died.

00:03:16.210 --> 00:03:19.920
Watase Aoba. The Alliance's new-type pilot.

00:03:19.920 --> 00:03:22.340
I'm asking you what your connection is with him.

00:03:22.340 --> 00:03:23.890
Nothing in particular!

00:03:24.390 --> 00:03:25.680
Then why did you protect him?!

00:03:27.430 --> 00:03:30.560
So you really were with him
on that island. Isn't that right?

00:03:34.230 --> 00:03:34.940
You...!

00:03:34.940 --> 00:03:37.400
You got it wrong! I never betrayed you guys!

00:03:37.400 --> 00:03:39.150
That was the first time I spoke to him!

00:03:39.150 --> 00:03:41.400
You expect me to believe that?

00:03:41.400 --> 00:03:42.570
I...

00:03:43.320 --> 00:03:47.280
I'm... not my father's daughter.

00:03:47.280 --> 00:03:48.240
What?

00:03:48.810 --> 00:03:53.620
I was an orphan of war who could only
remember that her name was "Hina".

00:03:53.620 --> 00:03:58.800
Father found me and raised me as his own daughter.

00:03:58.800 --> 00:04:02.470
He told me right before he died.

00:04:04.510 --> 00:04:12.350
When we were at the island,
Watase Aoba told me that I came from the past.

00:04:12.650 --> 00:04:14.140
The past?

00:04:14.140 --> 00:04:15.100
Yes.

00:04:15.820 --> 00:04:18.940
He told me that I saved his life 70 years ago,

00:04:18.940 --> 00:04:21.820
and brought him to this time period.

00:04:22.470 --> 00:04:24.110
What's with that ridiculous story?

00:04:25.200 --> 00:04:28.450
You're right. It's ridiculous, isn't it?

00:04:28.450 --> 00:04:34.370
But... he somehow knew who I was when we met.

00:04:34.370 --> 00:04:40.170
If I lost my childhood memories because of the shock of coming from the past...

00:04:40.170 --> 00:04:41.460
That's enough!

00:04:41.460 --> 00:04:45.550
Those are obviously lies to fool you!

00:04:45.550 --> 00:04:48.890
But he even said that this was mine!

00:04:48.890 --> 00:04:49.930
Stop this nonsense!

00:04:53.910 --> 00:04:54.600
Listen!

00:04:54.940 --> 00:04:59.570
Whatever you say will not change the fact that you were with an Alliance's pilot!

00:04:59.570 --> 00:05:04.490
If I were to report this, even Lieutenant Colonel Alfried wouldn't forgive you.

00:05:04.490 --> 00:05:07.490
I'm the only one who would forgive you.

00:05:07.490 --> 00:05:13.160
Forget all of that nonsense and do as I say, got it?

00:05:13.160 --> 00:05:14.870
I understand.

00:05:17.500 --> 00:05:18.710
Don't!

00:05:51.780 --> 00:05:54.370
Shift A, Bypass 2, still unstable.

00:05:54.680 --> 00:05:56.870
Coupling aptitude is a D+.

00:05:56.870 --> 00:06:01.170
With this, all the pilots here have failed the aptitude test for Coupling...

00:06:01.170 --> 00:06:02.590
except her.

00:06:03.870 --> 00:06:06.960
This is her first test and she's already showing such remarkable readings.

00:06:07.470 --> 00:06:15.180
You are truly the angel that promises Zogilia's and my own bright future, Hina Ryazan.

00:06:16.310 --> 00:06:19.520
You're telling me to pilot the Coupling mecha?

00:06:19.520 --> 00:06:22.730
Of course. You have excellent Coupler qualities.

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.120
You want to avenge your father, don't you?

00:06:25.820 --> 00:06:32.570
You can do that if you pilot my Valiancer which has an
unrivaled ability over the existing Coupling mechas.

00:06:32.570 --> 00:06:38.070
You can then easily seek redemption on the Alliance, who killed your father.

00:06:38.710 --> 00:06:40.210
You are who you are, right?

00:06:42.460 --> 00:06:44.590
Please give me some time to think about it.

00:06:45.860 --> 00:06:49.260
Of course. Take your time.

00:06:51.230 --> 00:06:51.930
What's that?

00:06:52.250 --> 00:06:57.770
A stimulant to repair a diverged brainwave after the experiment.

00:06:57.770 --> 00:07:00.230
Come, give me your arm.

00:07:00.230 --> 00:07:01.230
Yes, sir.

00:07:06.320 --> 00:07:08.400
You've seen Aoba-kun's memories?

00:07:08.400 --> 00:07:09.230
Yes.

00:07:10.120 --> 00:07:13.030
Right before Decoupling with SkyKnight,

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:16.290
a series of images flowed into my mind.

00:07:16.290 --> 00:07:19.410
The only explanation is that they were Aoba's memories.

00:07:19.410 --> 00:07:21.000
Is that even possible?

00:07:21.750 --> 00:07:26.300
The first Coupling mechas made Couplers have a strong connection with each other.

00:07:26.300 --> 00:07:30.970
The pilots happened to share not only the thoughts,
but their conscience and memories as well.

00:07:30.970 --> 00:07:33.390
Then what I saw was...

00:07:33.390 --> 00:07:35.390
Probably... my memories.

00:07:36.300 --> 00:07:40.390
Because of the pilots' strong psychological ties to the first-type mecha,

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:43.600
their Coupling performance is more powerful compared to present mechas.

00:07:43.600 --> 00:07:45.310
Isn't that a good thing?

00:07:45.620 --> 00:07:48.030
Only if they can control it.

00:07:48.630 --> 00:07:51.610
To have a stronger psychological connection means

00:07:51.610 --> 00:07:55.280
the boundary between yourself and your partner would become uncertain.

00:07:55.280 --> 00:07:58.490
If you continue Coupling under those circumstances,

00:07:58.490 --> 00:08:03.790
it'll be difficult to maintain your sense of self and will burden you with great psychological pressure.

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:07.170
The worst case scenario is death.

00:08:07.850 --> 00:08:11.380
This time, because your Emphater levels were high,

00:08:11.380 --> 00:08:13.550
you've experienced no more than just sharing your memories.

00:08:13.880 --> 00:08:15.680
You should be thankful that you were so lucky!

00:08:15.680 --> 00:08:16.850
Yes.

00:08:16.850 --> 00:08:18.560
By the way, Dio.

00:08:18.560 --> 00:08:22.940
You've seen Aoba's memories. What were they?

00:08:24.850 --> 00:08:26.650
It's hard to believe,

00:08:27.110 --> 00:08:29.610
but I've seen exact images of what Aoba described

00:08:29.610 --> 00:08:32.490
when he first boarded Luxon.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:37.820
His story about coming from the past may in fact be true.

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:39.240
Dio.

00:08:39.240 --> 00:08:40.160
That can't be...

00:08:40.160 --> 00:08:41.700
Impossible!

00:08:41.700 --> 00:08:43.710
It sounds like a lie, doesn't it?

00:08:43.710 --> 00:08:45.870
Captain, are you going to believe this?

00:08:47.500 --> 00:08:49.420
I'm not really sure.

00:08:49.420 --> 00:08:52.260
But in any case, nothing has changed, right?

00:08:52.260 --> 00:08:54.300
Th-That's right!

00:08:54.300 --> 00:08:57.010
Whatever happens, Aoba-san is Aoba-san!

00:08:57.010 --> 00:09:00.060
The same as before, a guy who came from the past.

00:09:00.060 --> 00:09:01.060
Mayuka-chan.

00:09:01.430 --> 00:09:03.570
Isn't that right, Elvira-san?

00:09:03.570 --> 00:09:05.270
That's true, but...

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:07.940
That's right, nothing has changed!

00:09:08.400 --> 00:09:11.650
How did you come into this time period, Aoba-kun?

00:09:11.650 --> 00:09:13.890
Well, that was when Hina saved me—

00:09:13.890 --> 00:09:16.030
That Zogilia pilot again.

00:09:16.430 --> 00:09:18.660
Why would the enemy save you

00:09:18.660 --> 00:09:20.830
and send you to this time period?

00:09:20.830 --> 00:09:23.040
Even if you ask me...

00:09:23.040 --> 00:09:24.410
What about you, Dio?

00:09:24.410 --> 00:09:26.210
I don't understand why either.

00:09:26.210 --> 00:09:27.460
But...

00:09:27.460 --> 00:09:30.000
You are going to the future.

00:09:30.350 --> 00:09:31.880
Trust me.

00:09:32.340 --> 00:09:36.830
Yumihara Hina definitely has all the answers to our questions.

00:09:38.920 --> 00:09:40.890
As of 13:00 of today,

00:09:40.890 --> 00:09:45.520
Ensign Hina Ryazan will be transferred
to the Fifth Division of the Administration Unit.

00:09:46.660 --> 00:09:49.060
That's absurd! Hina is now—

00:09:49.060 --> 00:09:52.650
There must be a mistake, Dr. Hahn.

00:09:52.650 --> 00:09:55.360
Ensign Ryazan has requested a furlough.

00:09:56.190 --> 00:09:58.910
That must be a mistake.

00:09:58.910 --> 00:10:02.370
She has volunteered to become a Coupler.

00:10:02.370 --> 00:10:04.080
Volunteered?

00:10:04.080 --> 00:10:08.170
Yeah, it appears that she desperately wants to avenge her father.

00:10:08.510 --> 00:10:10.710
Doesn't this make you want to cry?

00:10:11.170 --> 00:10:12.620
So, from this moment on,

00:10:12.620 --> 00:10:17.420
The military, including Lieutenant Colonel, of course, has no authority to interfere.

00:10:17.420 --> 00:10:19.220
Please keep that in mind.

00:10:21.180 --> 00:10:23.560
What the hell are you thinking, Hina?!

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:26.180
I will avenge my father.

00:10:26.180 --> 00:10:28.690
I told you to stay put!

00:10:28.690 --> 00:10:31.440
If that's what you want, I'll do...

00:10:31.440 --> 00:10:32.440
Hina?

00:10:33.000 --> 00:10:34.900
Glory to Zogilia.

00:10:37.390 --> 00:10:40.410
Did you know, Bizon Gerafil-kun?

00:10:40.910 --> 00:10:42.280
Dr. Hahn.

00:10:42.280 --> 00:10:50.080
Originally, a Coupler needs time to be
synchronized with the system and a Buddy.

00:10:50.080 --> 00:10:55.340
But in her case, she is already almost
perfectly synchronized with the system,

00:10:55.860 --> 00:10:57.590
but she doesn't have a Buddy yet.

00:10:59.840 --> 00:11:01.840
The solution to that is simple.

00:11:01.840 --> 00:11:03.800
I'll be her Buddy!

00:11:03.800 --> 00:11:10.100
Unfortunately, your Emphater waveform doesn't
match either the system or her waveform.

00:11:10.100 --> 00:11:10.810
Wha—?

00:11:11.430 --> 00:11:16.070
Having said that, there is no other suitable candidate.

00:11:16.070 --> 00:11:17.610
Wanna give it a shot?

00:11:17.610 --> 00:11:20.400
Trying to synchronize in a short time will be quite harsh.

00:11:20.400 --> 00:11:21.700
I don't care.

00:11:21.700 --> 00:11:25.910
If that will help Hina, I'll even let myself be burned by brimstone.

00:11:27.040 --> 00:11:29.000
That's a good resolve.

00:11:40.470 --> 00:11:42.130
Just wait, Hina.

00:11:42.130 --> 00:11:43.720
For your sake,

00:11:43.720 --> 00:11:46.220
I... I will...!

00:11:51.350 --> 00:11:55.430
Our main ship, with the Alliance Pacific Fleet,

00:11:55.430 --> 00:11:57.920
will be heading out to attack Zogilia's base.

00:11:58.570 --> 00:12:00.570
Since we've landed in Hawaii,

00:12:00.570 --> 00:12:04.780
I understand that everyone has not had enough time to rest.

00:12:04.780 --> 00:12:11.330
However, our next course of action is
an important one to turn the tides of battle.

00:12:11.330 --> 00:12:13.540
We're looking forward to your performance.

00:12:17.420 --> 00:12:19.800
Well, it's rather short notice, isn't it?

00:12:19.800 --> 00:12:22.380
With Luxon and Bradyon taken away,

00:12:22.380 --> 00:12:24.340
we have to hurry with the plan.

00:12:24.340 --> 00:12:27.890
If they trained Couplers,

00:12:27.890 --> 00:12:31.020
we'll end up fighting against the Coupling mechas.

00:12:31.020 --> 00:12:33.600
In that case, it's better to strike sooner.

00:12:33.600 --> 00:12:34.900
But you know...

00:12:34.900 --> 00:12:35.770
Yeah.

00:12:35.770 --> 00:12:39.520
Those higher-ups who were reluctant to
recognize the value of the Coupling mechas

00:12:39.520 --> 00:12:44.530
are now in fear ever since it fell into
enemy hands. It really is complicated.

00:12:44.530 --> 00:12:47.490
Captain, a call from Lieutenant General Green.

00:12:47.890 --> 00:12:50.700
I'm so sorry for the sudden battle, Kuramitsu-kun.

00:12:51.120 --> 00:12:52.160
Not at all.

00:12:52.160 --> 00:12:55.580
What's the status of the replacement new-type Coupling mechas?

00:12:55.580 --> 00:12:57.130
No need to worry.

00:12:57.500 --> 00:13:00.460
The ship carrying them has already left headquarters.

00:13:00.950 --> 00:13:03.470
You can meet up at the rendezvous point.

00:13:03.470 --> 00:13:06.180
The problem is the rendezvous point.

00:13:06.180 --> 00:13:08.760
Isn't it in the middle of the battlefield?

00:13:08.760 --> 00:13:10.720
It's a rather reckless plan.

00:13:10.720 --> 00:13:13.930
I heard that the Cygnus's Couplers were outstanding.

00:13:13.930 --> 00:13:15.730
I'm expecting results from you.

00:13:15.730 --> 00:13:18.610
What's with that? He's such a double talker.

00:13:18.930 --> 00:13:22.530
He's saying we can't afford to have
our precious Couplers relax.

00:13:22.530 --> 00:13:24.490
I understand how he feels, but...

00:13:24.490 --> 00:13:25.820
I don't mind.

00:13:25.820 --> 00:13:28.950
If I have a mecha to board, I'll fight.

00:13:28.950 --> 00:13:31.870
Come to think of it, where are we headed?

00:13:31.870 --> 00:13:33.700
Hmm? Alaska.

00:13:33.700 --> 00:13:35.000
Alaska?

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:35.760
That's right.

00:13:36.370 --> 00:13:37.500
Captain!

00:13:37.500 --> 00:13:39.040
It's fine!

00:13:39.040 --> 00:13:42.640
The information will be disclosed within 30 minutes anyway.

00:13:43.670 --> 00:13:44.670
What's that?

00:13:44.670 --> 00:13:48.640
A 420-meter Giant Nectar Cannon.

00:13:48.640 --> 00:13:51.100
We're calling it the Gorgon.

00:13:51.600 --> 00:13:54.980
It was secretly built by Zogilia,

00:13:54.980 --> 00:13:57.980
but you can't keep something of this colossal size hidden.

00:13:57.980 --> 00:14:00.860
The Alliance had knowledge of its construction,

00:14:00.860 --> 00:14:05.240
but we thought it would take more time to complete.

00:14:05.900 --> 00:14:10.370
However, this morning, the cannon began to charge up energy.

00:14:10.370 --> 00:14:12.330
Does that mean it's completed?

00:14:12.330 --> 00:14:13.330
Possibly, yes.

00:14:13.800 --> 00:14:18.710
Thanks to that,
the headquarters is in an uproar.

00:14:18.710 --> 00:14:21.080
The estimated blast yield is 50 Megatons,

00:14:21.580 --> 00:14:24.420
capable of leveling an entire city.

00:14:24.420 --> 00:14:25.050
Wha—?!

00:14:25.050 --> 00:14:26.130
Amazing.

00:14:26.760 --> 00:14:31.490
We're now planning an attack on the Gorgon in Zogilia's Alaska base.

00:14:34.970 --> 00:14:36.220
Let's see...

00:14:36.220 --> 00:14:38.270
Fiona called me.

00:14:38.270 --> 00:14:40.230
Oh, what did she say?

00:14:40.230 --> 00:14:42.980
She told me to say hello to you.

00:14:42.980 --> 00:14:44.860
I see. Is she doing alright?

00:14:44.860 --> 00:14:45.610
Yeah.

00:14:45.610 --> 00:14:49.650
She heard a big mission would take place from Father.

00:14:49.650 --> 00:14:52.910
The Alliance does such a sloppy job on controlling classified information.

00:14:54.370 --> 00:14:56.540
I wonder if she's on good terms with her father.

00:15:00.230 --> 00:15:01.960
You look as if you've made up your mind.

00:15:03.750 --> 00:15:06.210
Yup. I'll protect the Cygnus.

00:15:06.660 --> 00:15:08.920
If Hina is out there, what will you do?

00:15:13.320 --> 00:15:15.600
I can't fight her.

00:15:16.600 --> 00:15:18.220
That time...

00:15:18.220 --> 00:15:20.060
You can accept everything that you are now.

00:15:20.890 --> 00:15:22.070
Thank you.

00:15:22.940 --> 00:15:24.110
But...

00:15:24.110 --> 00:15:25.480
Hina!

00:15:25.480 --> 00:15:29.360
If only I'd forced her to come with me,
even if it had been against her will...

00:15:29.360 --> 00:15:31.820
Do you think you would have saved her by doing that?

00:15:31.820 --> 00:15:34.370
It wasn't that dramatic.

00:15:34.370 --> 00:15:38.790
I just couldn't leave her since she was suffering by herself...

00:15:40.750 --> 00:15:45.290
Do you understand how much danger you put yourself in?

00:15:45.290 --> 00:15:47.210
Yeah, I know.

00:15:47.630 --> 00:15:49.130
But still, I...

00:15:53.300 --> 00:15:56.140
Well, do whatever you want.

00:15:57.100 --> 00:16:00.320
It's you we're talking about. It's not like you'll listen.

00:16:01.060 --> 00:16:02.480
And...

00:16:03.140 --> 00:16:05.230
Dio is waiting for you.

00:16:08.730 --> 00:16:09.650
Dio?

00:16:10.280 --> 00:16:11.240
However...

00:16:11.240 --> 00:16:16.700
I, too, have someone to protect like you have Hina.

00:16:16.700 --> 00:16:19.160
So, if they face any danger,

00:16:19.160 --> 00:16:21.370
I'll choose to fight for them instead of Hina.

00:16:22.110 --> 00:16:23.760
Yeah, I understand.

00:16:24.370 --> 00:16:25.460
Thanks, Dio.

00:16:25.920 --> 00:16:28.750
Looks like I've caught your idiocy.

00:16:34.260 --> 00:16:35.470
Enemy sighted!

00:16:35.470 --> 00:16:36.760
20 large battleships.

00:16:36.760 --> 00:16:38.010
40 medium battleships.

00:16:38.010 --> 00:16:40.020
They've already crossed the outer perimeter!

00:16:40.020 --> 00:16:42.600
Those useless bastards from the intelligence bureau!

00:16:42.600 --> 00:16:45.650
Didn't they say the Alliance would head to Chitose to recapture the base?!

00:16:45.650 --> 00:16:48.980
Because of that, there isn't enough firepower here!

00:16:48.980 --> 00:16:50.360
Lieutenant General Kagan.

00:16:51.940 --> 00:16:54.820
What business do you have here, Secret Services agent Margaret?

00:16:54.820 --> 00:16:59.450
We have no time to solve the
Administration Bureau's problems.

00:16:59.450 --> 00:17:00.910
I have something to show you.

00:17:01.370 --> 00:17:02.410
Here.

00:17:04.830 --> 00:17:06.750
A plan?

00:17:06.750 --> 00:17:07.420
Wha—?

00:17:07.420 --> 00:17:09.590
There's no way this absurd plan would work!

00:17:09.980 --> 00:17:13.260
Then can you think of a better plan than this one,

00:17:13.260 --> 00:17:14.720
Commanding Officer?

00:17:16.970 --> 00:17:21.720
As you've requested, I made him accept the plan, Lieutenant Colonel Alfried.

00:17:21.720 --> 00:17:23.680
I'm glad to hear that.

00:17:23.680 --> 00:17:29.940
Thanks to you recommending this plan, if we were to win this fight against these overwhelming odds,

00:17:29.940 --> 00:17:34.610
you'll regain your lost ground in the Administrative Bureau.

00:17:36.030 --> 00:17:37.740
I won't thank you.

00:17:37.740 --> 00:17:39.120
That's fine.

00:17:39.120 --> 00:17:45.880
I merely used you to give me the edge in my fight.

00:17:45.880 --> 00:17:46.710
Excuse me.

00:17:54.710 --> 00:17:55.800
Hina!

00:17:57.550 --> 00:17:58.180
Bizon.

00:17:59.590 --> 00:18:00.760
Surprised, huh?

00:18:00.760 --> 00:18:01.720
Of course.

00:18:01.720 --> 00:18:05.930
This is all to become your Buddy.

00:18:05.930 --> 00:18:08.480
I will avenge my father.

00:18:08.480 --> 00:18:09.730
Yes.

00:18:09.730 --> 00:18:12.690
Let's avenge Lieutenant Commander Ryazan.

00:18:13.000 --> 00:18:14.900
Glory to Zogilia.

00:18:15.800 --> 00:18:17.000
Hina...

00:18:18.150 --> 00:18:21.240
Now, let's go. Let's kill Watase Aoba together.

00:18:21.640 --> 00:18:22.490
Yes.

00:18:23.610 --> 00:18:26.120
That's right.

00:18:52.110 --> 00:18:56.480
Can you tell me <i>why</i> we're being deployed when we only have three Valiancers capable of fighting?

00:18:56.480 --> 00:18:59.110
That's why we're on standby here.

00:18:59.110 --> 00:19:01.570
Once Dio and Aoba-kun's mechas arrive,

00:19:01.570 --> 00:19:04.500
we will definitely be ordered to move to the front line.

00:19:04.500 --> 00:19:05.660
For crying out loud.

00:19:05.660 --> 00:19:09.370
Now that the enemy got their hands on the Coupling mechas,
they suddenly started treating it differently.

00:19:11.880 --> 00:19:13.380
A message from the transport ship.

00:19:13.380 --> 00:19:15.240
They will arrive as scheduled.

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:15.880
Understood.

00:19:16.310 --> 00:19:18.420
High energy reading detected in the enemy's base.

00:19:18.760 --> 00:19:21.720
Energy levels on the Gorgon are rapidly increasing.

00:19:21.720 --> 00:19:24.850
Are they gonna shoot first before we even get to beat them?

00:19:24.850 --> 00:19:25.930
Don't panic!

00:19:26.270 --> 00:19:31.310
They need to charge it for at least half a day to reach the area under the Alliance army's control.

00:19:31.310 --> 00:19:31.980
Vice Commander!

00:19:31.980 --> 00:19:32.690
What?

00:19:32.690 --> 00:19:35.450
The Gorgon is... moving!

00:19:36.190 --> 00:19:38.480
Don't tell me... their target is our fleet!

00:19:38.480 --> 00:19:39.940
That's impossible!

00:19:40.430 --> 00:19:45.450
There are mountains between the cannon and us, you know?!

00:19:46.220 --> 00:19:48.160
Guidance System for shooting. Set.

00:19:48.430 --> 00:19:51.160
Nectorium beam has been charged.

00:19:51.160 --> 00:19:53.630
There's no turning back now.

00:19:53.630 --> 00:19:54.410
Yes.

00:19:54.920 --> 00:19:56.380
Garapushka...

00:19:56.380 --> 00:19:57.170
Fire!

00:20:04.140 --> 00:20:05.010
It's coming!

00:20:05.010 --> 00:20:05.760
Retreat!

00:20:15.900 --> 00:20:18.320
Enemy battle group, 51% are downed

00:20:18.320 --> 00:20:19.940
or destroyed.

00:20:19.940 --> 00:20:22.740
We did it. We did it!

00:20:22.740 --> 00:20:25.990
Commander, to clean up the surviving enemies,

00:20:25.990 --> 00:20:28.080
the Valiancer units will launch.

00:20:28.460 --> 00:20:30.080
Okay, permission granted.

00:20:30.500 --> 00:20:33.040
Orders from headquarters: continue with the plan!

00:20:33.040 --> 00:20:36.540
All ships, get back into formation!

00:20:36.540 --> 00:20:38.250
U-Understood.

00:20:49.930 --> 00:20:52.890
Don't bother with the ships that are falling.

00:20:52.890 --> 00:20:54.440
The same goes for escaping ships.

00:20:54.440 --> 00:20:55.440
Roger!

00:20:58.650 --> 00:20:59.400
They're coming.

00:20:59.400 --> 00:21:01.030
Spread out and attack.

00:21:14.330 --> 00:21:16.500
You two! You're flying too high!

00:21:16.500 --> 00:21:17.710
They'll surround you!

00:21:17.710 --> 00:21:19.920
Lieutenant Commander, it's me.

00:21:20.260 --> 00:21:23.050
Bizon? Why are you in that uniform?

00:21:23.050 --> 00:21:24.990
I'm sorry for the late report.

00:21:24.990 --> 00:21:28.090
I am now under the Administration Bureau with Hina.

00:21:28.440 --> 00:21:30.850
So, let me do as I please.

00:21:31.350 --> 00:21:32.350
That means...

00:21:32.850 --> 00:21:34.100
That mecha is Hina?

00:21:49.160 --> 00:21:50.580
Bizon...

00:21:50.580 --> 00:21:51.830
Hina...

00:21:51.830 --> 00:21:53.580
How long are you gonna make us wait?!

00:21:53.580 --> 00:21:55.500
We're examining the situation.

00:21:55.500 --> 00:21:57.040
Please wait a little while longer!

00:21:57.040 --> 00:22:00.130
While we're doing that, all will be lost!

00:22:00.710 --> 00:22:02.460
Are our mechas alright?

00:22:02.460 --> 00:22:04.760
The shot missed,

00:22:04.760 --> 00:22:07.300
but after the chaos, we can't confirm their positions.

00:22:07.300 --> 00:22:08.470
It can't be...

00:22:08.470 --> 00:22:10.350
Once we find them, we'll contact you.

00:22:10.350 --> 00:22:11.680
Until then, remain on standby.

00:22:15.170 --> 00:22:18.920
With my heart, I call out

00:22:18.920 --> 00:22:23.300
To the far side, mutually drawn

00:22:23.300 --> 00:22:27.810
Forgetting even the reason I ache

00:22:27.810 --> 00:22:32.440
Just for now, please

00:22:32.440 --> 00:22:36.610
I know you

00:22:36.610 --> 00:22:41.110
I'm searching for you

00:22:41.240 --> 00:22:43.570
Softly pressing my lips

00:22:43.570 --> 00:22:50.160
to the bright afterimage I can't keep from leaving

00:22:50.160 --> 00:22:58.710
If hesitation is what gives way to the slightest of hopes

00:22:58.710 --> 00:23:03.340
To the many gentle mornings...

00:23:03.340 --> 00:23:07.890
and the times I have wondered

00:23:07.890 --> 00:23:12.140
In the future that leads back to that sky,

00:23:12.140 --> 00:23:14.350
I want to save you,

00:23:14.350 --> 00:23:16.480
I want to protect you

00:23:16.480 --> 00:23:20.860
In the future that arrives at that dream

00:23:20.860 --> 00:23:23.740
Wait for me

00:23:23.740 --> 00:23:28.490
The love we'll surely find

00:23:28.490 --> 00:23:33.290
I want you to reach out for it

00:23:35.990 --> 00:23:38.560
Next episode, on Buddy Complex:

00:23:38.560 --> 00:23:39.830
"Acception."
